#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/24
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I think it really shaped my sense of humor. It was... special."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My grandmother used to make me cookies. Bad ones, but still."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awww, that's so sweet."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-18/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "But still... Even if the moment wasn't great, sometimes the memory is still important."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-18/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Weird, how time does that, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "She was awesome. All those actors are probably gone now, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Super weird, how much time has gone by."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Yeah, Bodhi. I think they're all gone."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sapphire was the first to go I think. But Tulip lived to be 99 and made people laugh the entire time!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hmmm. Yeah. I guess that makes sense, though."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-10/c-19/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh wow! Well. Good for her. She was a radical lady."
