#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Need a minute?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah, I think I want to be alone for a bit. That okay?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Something I did?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course. Take all the time you like."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/c-22/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh no, of course not."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/c-22/15 bodhi_capsule/bodhi_on_couch/0/g-12/c-23/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It's just that I'm feeling a little out of place... or time."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Whoa, buddy, hey! Nice to see ya!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Bodhi! Found your way to the office I see."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Bodhi! How's that computer treating you?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah, it's awesome in here! Seems like somewhere you spend a lot of time."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Pretty cool, pal-i-o, pretty cool."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So, have you had some time to catch up on, oh I dunno, the 21st century?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you think of this \"brave new world\"?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah, there's... a lot."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It's all a little overwhelming."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Overwhelming makes sense. Is there something that you are still psyched about?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm... I think I know what you mean."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Sure! I try to be a positive time capsule. The whole \"internet\" thing is pretty bitchin'. I think?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"You think\"?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bitchin' for sure."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Well, yeah. I mean, it's actually insane. Borderline inconceivable."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You have the collective knowledge of all humanity at your finger tips."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Still... you all use it for, like, fight videos and arguing with strangers? Maybe even FAKE strangers. \"AI\" I'm not sure I get it."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah... Can't say you're wrong."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It's just that... ALL of that technology. Information. Possibility. And this is what we did with it?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I was so sure we'd have like cured cancer and have flying cars by now."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "And there is a really fantastic amount of porn."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/24
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Like, porn, go for it, whatever but... who needs this much??"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes. I'm sorry porn was your gateway to the internet, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a lot. All kinds of people have visibility now, so that's good."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/32/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I guess. I'm just a little tired. Overwhelmed. Kinda bummed out. I really need a pick me up. And you know what never bums me out?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/32/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What's always there for me??"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_second_encounter/0/g-1/19/c-5/15/g-0/24/g-0/32/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "...MOVIES!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Movies, movies, movies, always and forever, my dude!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah, I LOVE 80's flicks."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know many."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/c-0/7 bodhi_capsule/movies/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "There are so many classics!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Cindy Bandana Jones, E-Tea, Ferriswheel Bueller’s Day Off, Fast Times at Fridgemont High, 17 Candles, Grill and Shed’s Excellent Adventure!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Totally! Those are fantastic films!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those aren't bad."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not my fav..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Right?! So fun."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Not BAD!?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What??!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Okay, okay, what are your favs?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Beverly Hills Stop Sign"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Princess Slide"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do The Right Things"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hahahah, oh man, so funny. Can't get that tune out of my head! Bum, bum, bum, bum, bum, bum buuummmm..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "As you wish!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "So poignant. Love a Spike Tree joint!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Comedy, Action, Fantasy, Animation, Drama!! You've got some really diverse taste."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-2/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks Bodhi!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-2/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I don't know..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Heck yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Sure ya do!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Y'know what, that's actually something I've discovered about your time that I think is pretty rad."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You've got so many different kinds of faces now."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You've got all these different personalities and perspectives and stuff. I mean we had it, kinda, but you've really just gone so much further!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Black, White, Asian, Arab, Indigenous... Oh and those people with all of those LETTERS?!?!?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What letters?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Say that last part again?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/c-10/7 bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You know Ligibitdiqua!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hahah, you mean LGBTQIA+"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "YEAH!! That's the one. There is a lot to learn there, buddy, believe you me."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey. I guess that's something that your internet is great for!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/23
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Learnin' stuff."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/31
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It's amazing."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/39
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I was so much of my own time, I didn't even realize how pale things were looking in ol' Hollywood."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/47
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I still love my movies, but sometimes now when I see the jokes... the humor was way tough on anyone that was different."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/55
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Maybe your generation doesn't have flying cars yet, but you're making stories about people I never thought I'd get to know. And that's definitely bodacious."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/66/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, Bodhi, we've definitely been making an effort! I'm honored you noticed."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/66/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "80's movies are still great though! It's healthy to be able to enjoy things and also know they aren't perfect."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/66/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Good to hear it, compadre."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-4/c-12/66/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah! Oh, that's a great point! You're right, compadre."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Anyway, it was really nice talking to you. I, uh... I've been pretty lonely for a while."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get that."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Could have fooled me. You're super nice, and you're insightful, and you're funny... I don't know! I'll bet you're pretty popular!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-6/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't relate."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-6/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean... with these dateviators I'm popular here!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-6/c-15/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Ha! Doesn't surprise me. You are way too cool. Smart, funny, nice... I bet you go on TONS of dates."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Got me talkin' at ya!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Anyway, great hang."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I'm gonna cruise around a bit, see some more of the house and catch up on the 2000's!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Later gator!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "After a while crocodile!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Peace out!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/c-18/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Wait, is it peace out now?? I thought we had Pans Across America!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/movies/0/g-7/c-18/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Nevermind. I'll figure it out. I got this!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Vibe, baby... Hey man, I'm just vibin'!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey. Come on over here and test my vibe!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bodhi? You doin' ok?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey buddy. Do I need to be worried about you?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I am so good. I've been researching and checking out the house and generally vibin' on all these new decades!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you doing in the dining room?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How have you been?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh you know, just vibin'..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey, am I using that right? I've been practicing a bunch of different uses in sentences and stuff and, I don't know, it sounds weird."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you're getting it, mostly!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty close..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/0/b/1
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Whew... okay... I've been chatting with Rainey, she's been playing some tunes!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I dig that you have a record player. Old School. Been listening to some of your \"new\" music too. I like it! Well, most of it."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yeah? What kind of music are you into?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh wow, there's so much stuff I like! Pop, Punk, Rap, R&B, Rock, Soul. Even Disco. But don't tell anybody."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/18
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "As an 80's guy, I'm supposed to be pretty strongly opposed to disco. Which is dumb. Because disco is so cool."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got any favorites?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Well yeah! Um, from my era, I love Tommy Tree and Nikki Seven from Mötley Crüeneck, Axles Roses, Brick James, Richie Sambuca, Yngwie Malmsteam, oh, and Pill Spector is like, the best producer ever."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/26/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uuummm..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-2/c-6/26/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hate to tell you this, but all of the folks you just named are really problematic, Bodhi."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hahahah! Oh yeah. They're WILDMEN!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No Bodhi, they're CANCELLED."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bodhi, they're not wild. They're bad people."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What, like their new records got canned?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "No. If it was that, you would've just said that."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What does \"cancelled\" mean?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It means that someone's poor choices and negative actions have caused pretty much everyone to universally shun them."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Well, wait. Do they have a chance to say sorry?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda. It's rare."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh bummer, dude. So you met them all. And you know they're no good?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I haven't met them. I don't need to. I know the things they've done. We don't really look up to any of the people you named anymore."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "So you haven't met them, but... you sure?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure. I think Pill Spector actually killed somebody."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-3/c-7/18/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What?? That's... deep bummer right there."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "So that's it then? All of my favorite artists are cancelled? Like, they won't make any more music?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably not."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything is possible... technically."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-8/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "But not likely."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, Bodhi."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "But what about forgiveness? Second chances? Redemption?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not that simple anymore I'm afraid."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want a list of the messed up stuff they did?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Huh. That's okay. I think I understand. I think..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-4/c-9/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Um, no. I do not want that."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You doing okay?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah. Just a lot to absorb."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Kinda hurts that a lot of my icons turned out to be bad people."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/23
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It's confusing, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it. Still happens today, actually. We just find out about it a lot faster."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My generation is having a lot of conversations about \"separating the art from the artist\". You can still enjoy the songs. Just... different awareness, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/31/c-0/7 bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-5/c-10/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Well, it sounds like the music industry had a lot of issues, but hey, at least my favorite actors, authors, sports stars and comedians are okay, right?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who were they?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Bell Gibson, H.P. Hovercraft, Orange Juice Simpson and Drill Cosby."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh-oh."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/15/c-0/7 bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/15/c-1/7 bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-6/c-11/15/c-2/13
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "WHAT NOW?!?!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_dining_room/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I'M OUT I'M OUT I'M OUT!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey compadre."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa, is that Bedroom Bodhi I see?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Snugged up in my bed, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Haha, yeah. Bedroom Bodhi! I sound like a superhero. It's peaceful in here."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Haha, yeah. Hope you don't mind."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not at all! I like it in here, too."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No problem. After all, you've lived here longer than me."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Thanks for letting me have free range of the house."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bodhi looks off into the distance somewhere—he's clearly not his usual chipper self."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem lost in thought."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I do something to deserve the silent treatment?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I've just... I've been thinkin' a lot, my dude. About a lot of stuff."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I've just... I've had a lot to think about."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Such as?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I dunno. I'm not used to... being bummed out! Are you sure I'm not bumming you, with my bummed-ness?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not bummed. Go ahead and talk."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're closer to making me laugh. Which is good! Talk."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Okay. It's like this."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Nostalgia is a powerful thing, right? You for sure don't think while something is happening, 'whoa, I'm gonna miss this.'"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I mean sure, you might realize it's \"good\", but you don't always realize that it's also finite. It's gonna end. Every moment ends."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "It might be kind of a big thing to grasp the meaning of the era you live in or the impact it might have on the world. And your soul."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I should know, amigo! I'm the 80's and just look at me."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Sure, people remember me fondly because of the style, music and media of the times, but..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "...I don't know, are they remembering the REAL me? Or are they remembering and longing for who they were, then?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Think about it. Reaganomics, The hole in the ozone layer, Exxon Valdez, The Challenger, Chernobyl, The War on Drugs, The Central Park 5, The Iran Contra Affair, AIDS for god's sake..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "That's all me. That stuff was a pretty big downer. Definitely doesn't sound like stuff to miss."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I'm just feeling like... maybe I wasn't as great as I thought I was."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But Bodhi, EVERY decade is a mess. Nothing is perfect, but that doesn't mean it doesn't have merit. People remember you for good things, too!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But Bodhi, EVERY decade is a mess. Nothing is perfect, but that doesn't mean it doesn't have merit. People love you for who you are... I love you for who you are."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I don't know, how about The Fall of the Iron Curtain, computers, mobile phones, the internet, VIDEOGAMES and so much. Bodhi... you're amazing."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Wait. What did you just say?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I said... I love you."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You do?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Everything about you. Even your flaws."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I... I love you too!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I love you so much... uh oh, bucko, hold on... I feel a power ballad comin' on!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I... I've never had a friend like you. I mean, I've never had a friend from the future before!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/8
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You've literally brought me out of the past! How cool is that?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/19
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Because of you, because of what I've learned, I feel like I could actually have a future."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, you ARE the 80's."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Yeah. Can only be who I am, I guess..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Which meeeaaannns. You could also be the 2080's!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Wah... aaa... aahhahahaAHAHAH YEAH!!! I guess that's right isn't it! The 2080's, huh? Wonder what it'll be like?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You think they'll still have time capsules then? Ooh, dude, maybe they'll be made out of some crazy futuristic polymer or something!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just hoping for less spandex and neon."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like we'll find out together... compadre."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I happen to be a pretty big fan of spandex. And neon."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "And leg warmers."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/31
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "And fingerless gloves."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/39
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "And lace and fishnet t-shirts! And frizzy perms! And bright eye shadow! And tight jeans and sneakers!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/Bodhi_friendshipconclusion/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Aaahhh so tubular, friend!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh yeah here we go, it's time to feel it!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh my god, is this happening?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm definitely feelin' it!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You bet your booty it's happening!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "The music of LOVE!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go, Bodhi, SING TO ME!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_2/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "BITCHIN'!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh hey, HATER."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where'd you learn that word?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hater says what? (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/7/b/1 bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/9/b/1
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Vaughn. He may have been a grumpy little weirdo, but at least he's not keeping me PRISONER!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Vaughn. He may be a grumpy little weirdo, but at least he's not keeping me PRISONER!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/12/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Listen..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/12/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Leave me alone. Unless it's time for you to lower the lotion down in a basket."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/12/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do you know that reference?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/12/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "What the hell else do I have to do with my time but LEARN STUFF, ya heartless monster?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-0/12/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "JUST GET OUTTA HERE!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Not falling for that."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you cracked a smile!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "The only thing that's getting cracked is my patience."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You bringing me up into the house or nah?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, come on, Bodhi. Welcome home."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Seriously?? Ha! I can't believe that worked!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_hate_return/0/c-1/19/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Let's do this. Couch surfing here we come!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey compadre, how are ya?!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good I guess, what are you up to?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I've actually come to Realize you! If you're into it."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Just discovering some new stuff. Still vibin' and rockin' and... y'know, trying to stay current."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Hey, also, I found this old box of DISCS!! Some of them say CD. Ah, I could never afford a player... Some of them say DVD? And some of them look like movies, and some of them look like music?!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I don't know, though, because they're all so tiny?? It's crazy! I'm totally into it!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, we really don't use those— you know what, nevermind. It's gnarly, right?!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "TOTALLY!! Wanna watch some with me?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely I do! A little nostalgia is good for the soul!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_friend_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Nostalgia?! This is cutting edge for me, pal-i-o! Spin those lasers!! OOOOWWW!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh hey, there, ya sexpot! Back again?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I missed ya!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! I've actually come to Realize you, Bodhi!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Same here. Listen, I've been thinking about that scene with Patrick Daisy in \"Toast\" and it's kinda making me wonder if you'd wanna do some... <i>ahem</i> \"pottery\" with me?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds messy."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Uh huh. Definitely. Gotta get a good mess on! But FIRST!..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I feel the need... the need... to serenade ya with a power ballad!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you'd never ask!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As good as that sounds, you had me at pottery."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "SICK!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh heck yes. Let's glaze it up!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The time spent with Bodhi spinning pottery makes time fly by faster than you ever imagined..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Whoa. Hold on there, amigo. Realize?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/11
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "How many badass things are you gonna do for me?? First you wake me up, then you show me all these bodacious years I missed, and now... now I'm gonna get Realized??"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're into it, then."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, yeah, if you stop talking, sure!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh, I'm into it. Big time. Let's goooooo...."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Are you ready to rock right now?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep! Buckle up!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha. As long as you're ready. I'm not quite, but I'll come back!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_join/0/g-0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh, you'd better come back. I'll be here, continuing my education, so to speak!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Gnarly gnarly, my friend, are we doing this??"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yes. Prepare yourself, Bodhi!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Almost! A few more things!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Brochacho, you are so very lucky that I am patient. Like whoa."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "I hope this tech isn't bogus... let's start with Bodhi and see if it works!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Bodhi - let's get radical!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a time capsule, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Duh duh duh DUH!! Here I am, alive and in the flesh. Gotta love it baby!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realized/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well well, you look ready to take on the world, my friend!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realized/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gonna sing me a sexy song again? I hope so..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Oh I'm gonna do a lot more than sing!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Although definitely I'm gonna sing."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/19
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You know what I didn't get to do when I was learning all that stuff about the times that came after me?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/27
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Dance! I never got to dance. And there are so many good dances..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/38
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Would you dance with me?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bodhi. Are you finally asking me out on a date?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Finally? Wait..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "You wanted me to ask you out?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well DUH!!!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Wow... I feel like such a doofus right now."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "Consider yourself asked out. Asked out times a million. You are one radical human, and I'm gonna date the heck outta ya!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bodhi proved true to his word. You sang and laughed and watched movies new and old, and at one point danced around in nothing but socks and white button down shirts."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/37
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You fall asleep holding hands, talking in the brief moments before unconsciousness of all the things in this new world you wanted to see together."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just before sleep finally overtakes you, you realize that Bodhi has made you see your own time as new. And fresh. And wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_divert/0/c-0/23/c-0/53
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "And how radical is that?"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bodhi made sure to say a very musical goodbye to you before he left in the morning."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When asked what he planned on doing, what would be his ambition for his new life, he replied only..."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/19
msgctxt "Bodhi"
msgid "I dunno yet! I've still got a lot to learn so... I guess I'll figure something out!"
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He bounced around doing odd jobs, and quite happily, too, until he found himself working at a movie studio as a coffee delivery guy."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "One day, delivering an order of iced lattes to a closed set on one of the sound stages he heard snatches of the music he recognized from his history as a time capsule."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He saw frizzy perms. Tight jeans with sneakers. Bright leggings with leg warmers."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He had delivered coffee to the set of the first season of Stranger Rings."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He couldn't contain his excitement, or his emotion, and the director soon noticed the kooky coffee delivery boy in the corner who seemed to know all the references and all the mannerisms so much better than the actors or even the writers."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Although he of course couldn't tell the director why he knew the 80's as well as he did, he was able to label himself an \"enthusiast.\""
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_love_join/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Works for me, thought the grateful director. Bodhi was soon thereafter hired as a \"consultant.\" He goes to work grinning every single day."
msgstr ""

#: bodhi_capsule/bodhi_realize_zoey/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh, mysterious. Okay! Free necklace!"
msgstr ""
